{"data":{"status":true,"competition":{"id":1764132,"visibility":"public","theme_colour":"blue_un","paid":0,"title":"Idea got Latent","festival_id":520881,"organization_id":943045,"web_url":null,"start_date":"2026-10-01T00:00:00+05:30","end_date":"2026-10-22T16:00:00+05:30","location":null,"type":"competitions","public_url":"competitions\/idea-got-latent-bharati-vidyapeeths-college-of-engineering-1764132","region":"offline","details":"<div id=\"model-response-message-contentr_bfad5790b52a8132\" class=\"markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger tutor-markdown-rendering\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-busy=\"false\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"0\">About the Event<\/h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"1\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"1\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Ideas Got Latent<\/strong> is a high-stakes idea-pitching challenge with a unique twist: <strong data-path-to-node=\"1\" data-index-in-node=\"79\">Can you judge your own idea as accurately as the panel does?<\/strong><\/p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"2\">In this edition, participants present an original concept focused on <strong data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"69\">Sustainable Development<\/strong>, specifically addressing <strong data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"118\">SDG 1 (No Poverty)<\/strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"138\">SDG 2 (Zero Hunger)<\/strong>, or <strong data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"162\">SDG 10 (Reduced Inequalities)<\/strong>. Before stepping on stage, teams secretly rate their own idea out of 10. Once the pitch is complete, the judges independently score the idea based on innovation, feasibility, and social impact.<\/p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">Matching your predicted score unlocks instant bonus goodies, while delivering the strongest overall pitch competes for the main championship cash prize!<\/p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Motto:<\/strong> <em data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"7\">Your Idea. Their Score. Real Impact.<\/em><\/p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"6\">Round Wise Details<\/h2>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"7\">Round 1: Secret Self-Rating &amp; SDG Pitch<\/h3>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Secret Rating:<\/strong> Prior to stepping on stage, each participant or team privately submits a self-rating (scale 1&ndash;10) for their idea. This rating remains locked and hidden from the judges.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Pitch:<\/strong> Participants deliver their presentation to the panel, covering the target problem, selected SDG(s), proposed solution, target beneficiaries, uniqueness, feasibility, and social impact.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Q&amp;A &amp; Scoring:<\/strong> The panel conducts a Q&amp;A session and independently evaluates the idea to assign a final score.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"9\">Round 2: Score Comparison &amp; Prize Distribution<\/h3>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Match Bonus (Win Goodies):<\/strong> The participant's secret predicted score is unsealed and compared against the final judges' score. If both scores match, the team wins special bonus goodies worth <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"194\">\u20b9_____<\/strong>!<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Main Winner Evaluation (Cash Prize):<\/strong> Irrespective of the score match, the overall tournament winner is selected purely based on the highest-quality, most impactful, and feasible idea as evaluated by the judging panel.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"12\">Rules and Guidelines<\/h2>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"13\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">SDG Relevance:<\/strong> Every idea must directly address <strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"48\">SDG 1, SDG 2, and\/or SDG 10<\/strong>. Participants must clearly state which SDG(s) their solution targets. Ineligible ideas will be disqualified.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Participation:<\/strong> Open to individual participants or teams (as permitted by the organizers). Each entry may present only <strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"118\">one<\/strong> idea.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Secret Rating Rules:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"13,2,1\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,2,1,0,0\">Self-ratings cannot be altered once submitted privately.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,2,1,1,0\">Predicted scores are used strictly for the bonus goodies challenge and do <strong data-path-to-node=\"13,2,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"74\">not<\/strong> influence the selection of the main cash prize winner.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Evaluation Criteria:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"13,3,1\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,3,1,0,0\">Relevance to target SDG(s) &amp; depth of problem understanding<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,3,1,1,0\">Innovation, originality &amp; feasibility<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,3,1,2,0\">Scalability, potential social impact &amp; pitch clarity<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Final Authority:<\/strong> In the event of ties or disputes, the decision of the judges and organizing committee is final and binding.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>For Queries Contact : -<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>Faizaan Alam<\/strong> - 9319955443<\/p>\n<p><strong>Vasvi<\/strong> - 9891012471<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>","overall_prizes":null,"regn_open":1,"regn_type":1,"regn_url":null,"regn_email":"","registration_clicks":0,"user_id":33478161,"moderation_status":1,"overall_leaderboard":0,"reject_reason":null,"display_date":null,"created_at":"2026-10-01T12:50:19+05:30","updated_at":"2026-10-04T03:01:47+05:30","communication_sent":null,"certificate_at":null,"remarks":null,"branding":0,"disable_auto_rounds":null,"certificate_config":null,"subtype":"general_competition","combined_leaderboard":null,"source":null,"short_id":"rF0MQd3","hashtags":null,"participation_certificate":0,"winner_certificate_at":null,"listed":1,"self_moderated":2,"prizes_release_days":null,"checked":null,"display_title":null,"show_discussions_only_user":1,"show_reviews_only_user":1,"show_score_card":0,"players_count":69,"referral_leaderboard_show":0,"is_ad_free":0,"enable_gamify_leaderboard":0,"tpo_college_id":null,"publish_at":"2026-10-01 12:53:00","auto_shortlist_trigger":false,"enable_ai_discussion":false,"total_unlock_teams":0,"enable_hiring_automation":false,"auto_send_participation_certificate":true,"closed_at":null,"linkedInEventId":"","teams":[],"players":[],"logoUrl":"https:\/\/d8it4huxumps7.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/images\/75x75\/uploadedManual-6abe09d4bce6f_bvestlogo_final_1.png","logoUrl2":"https:\/\/d8it4huxumps7.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/images\/150x150\/uploadedManual-6abe09d4bce6f_bvestlogo_final_1.png","regnRequirements":{"id":2495740,"opportunity_id":1764132,"festival_id":null,"max_team_size":6,"min_team_size":1,"start_regn_dt":"2026-10-01T00:00:00+05:30","end_regn_dt":"2026-10-18T22:00:00+05:30","show_deadline":1,"open_for":0,"college_typ